<title>USA: Sea Containers sets qtly dividends.</title>
<headline>Sea Containers sets qtly dividends.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sea Containers Limited set quarterly dividends of $0.1925 per share for its class A common shares and $0.175 per share for its class B common shares on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The dividends, unchanged from the previous quarter, will be payable Feb 21 to shareholders of record Feb 5.</p>
<p>The company said class B common shares are convertible into class A common shares at any time.</p>
</text>
